IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. HELLO-WORLD.
DATA DIVISION.
    WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01 salary  PIC 9(8).
        01 debt PIC 9(8).
        01 draft PIC 9(8).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY "ENTER YOUR SALARY:"
    ACCEPT salary
    DISPLAY "ENTER YOUR MONTHLY DEBT:"
    ACCEPT debt
    DISPLAY "ENTER YOUR OVERDRAFT REQUEST AMOUNT:"
    ACCEPT draft
    IF debt<=((salary*40)/100) AND draft<=(salary*2)
        DISPLAY "ELIGIBLE"
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "NOT ELIGIBLE"
    END-IF.
    
    
STOP RUN.
